&lt;h2 id=&#34;about&#34;&gt;About
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;LocalSend is a cross-platform app that enables secure communication between devices using a REST API and HTTPS encryption. Unlike other messaging apps that rely on external servers, LocalSend doesn&amp;rsquo;t require an internet connection or third-party servers, making it a fast and reliable solution for local communication.&lt;/p&gt;
